Wine win32u: drop the game's own keyboard and mouse input while the Steam overlay is open under the Wayland driver, and let the overlay bridge hide and restore the game cursor. Rebased from GE-Proton11-9 (em-fixups 0007 and 0053); the bridge runs only when WINE_WAYLAND_STEAM_OVERLAY_LAYER is 1.
Applies to wine-cachyos with: patch -p1 --forward --fuzz=0 -i <this file>

